<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, AUG 8.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, AUG 8.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, Aug 8</p>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Aug 08	Aug 07   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  292.550     293.850     247.020    18.43 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  307.830     307.850     306.830     0.33 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.530     156.205     158.970    -1.53 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.412	46.306	47.182    -1.63 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  458.460     470.420     419.180     9.37 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  138.925     138.660     141.685    -1.95 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.039	15.972	16.185    -0.90 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  248.250     247.530     212.430    16.86 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.856	 1.850	1.8880    -1.69 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.549	 1.543	1.5810    -2.02 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  191.245     191.810     183.135     4.43 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December 31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
